WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.166
<b><font color='#000000'>If your submitted data package needs further revision</font></b>

2
00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:06.625
<b><font color='#000000'>you will find it under the status "Needs Rework".</font></b>

3
00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:10.708
<b><font color='#000000'>To figure out why your package was rejected, use the "Settings" symbol.</font></b>

4
00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:13.958
<b><font color='#000000'>Here you can find the reviews of your data curator.</font></b>

5
00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:18.625
<b><font color='#000000'>If you want to edit your package, for example to add some additional data, </font></b>

6
00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:22.500
<b><font color='#000000'>use the Edit project button in the top right-hand corner. </font></b>

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.708
<b><font color='#000000'>Your data package is now back in the edit mode.</font></b>

8
00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:31.000
<b><font color='#000000'>Here you can add further data, and delete or restructure your data as required.</font></b>

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.041
<b><font color='#000000'>You can find more information on how to edit your data under "Editor". </font></b>

10
00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:37.875
<b><font color='#000000'>To leave the edit mode, use the back arrow.</font></b>

11
00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:43.500
<b><font color='#000000'>If necessary, you can also edit the metadata here by using the book symbol.</font></b>

12
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.416
<b><font color='#000000'>Once you have completed the revision of your data package, </font></b>

13
00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:50.791
<b><font color='#000000'>you can submit it again for review using the "Submit package" button. </font></b>

14
00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:54.000
<b><font color='#000000'>The package is now again shown under "In Review".</font></b>

15
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
<b><font color='#000000'>If a further revision is necessary and the responsible curator rejects your package again, </font></b>

16
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
<b><font color='#000000'>you will find it under the status "Needs Rework". </font></b>

17
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.958
<b><font color='#000000'>If your data package requires no further revision, </font></b>

18
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:08.000
<b><font color='#000000'>the curator will submit it directly to the archive. </font></b>

19
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.333
<b><font color='#000000'>Your data package will then appear with the status "Archived".</font></b>

20
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:15.416
<b><font color='#000000'>Please note that at this point you will no longer be able to edit your data.</font></b>

